    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66967" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετασυγ-κρίνω</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>alter the
				state of the pores</i>, a term of the Methodic school of
			medicine, Thessal. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.250
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.6
			</span></i>, etc.: —hence Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετασύγ-κρῐσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.268
			</span></i>: Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετασυγ-κρῐτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, δύναμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					4.153
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.571
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>
			v. l. in Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.166
			</span></i>.</div>
